Purpose: Reduce redundancy and improve data integrity.

Normal Forms:
1NF: No repeating groups; atomic values.
2NF: 1NF + no partial dependency.
3NF: 2NF + no transitive dependency.
BCNF: Stronger version of 3NF.

Example:
Unnormalized: StudentID, StudentName, Subject1, Subject2
1NF: Split subjects into separate rows
2NF & 3NF: Split into separate tables for Students and Subjects
